# EXAMPLE: bring up four GPCs and two CRTs through the NBAT to OPS 2, waiting on
# panel O6 talkbacks instead of fixed times.  Run from discretePanel/:
#
#   python3 simulatePASS.py --gpcs 1-4 --crts 2 --tape OI340700-v44boot.mmv \
#       --panel-script examples/4gpc-startup-panel.script \
#       --keys examples/4gpc-startup-keys.txt --duration 900
#
# Pair with examples/4gpc-startup-keys.txt.  Verified 2026-09-15 (OPS 2 typed
# about 570 s after the panel started, against 840 s with fixed times).
#
# The four-GPC 2-CRT start-up (perf-in/panel.script), waiting on the O6 MODE
# talkbacks instead of fixed times: each GPC is taken to RUN as soon as its
# talkback shows RUN (load complete).  Times after a wait count from it.
0 gpc 1
0 mode HALT
0.01 gpc 2
0.02 mode HALT
0.03 gpc 3
0.04 mode HALT
0.05 gpc 4
0.06 mode HALT
0.08 idppower 1 on
0.09 idppower 2 on
0.1 crt 1
0.2 source MM1
0.4 gpc 1
0.5 ipl
3 mode STANDBY
wait gpc 1 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1 crt 0
3 mode RUN
5 source OFF
10 gpc 2
11 source MM1
12 crt 2
12.5 idpload 2
13 ipl
16 mode STANDBY
wait gpc 2 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1 crt 0
3 mode RUN
5 source OFF
10 gpc 3
11 source MM1
12 crt 2
12.5 idpload 2
13 ipl
16 mode STANDBY
wait gpc 3 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1 crt 0
3 mode RUN
5 source OFF
10 gpc 4
11 source MM1
12 crt 2
12.5 idpload 2
13 ipl
16 mode STANDBY
wait gpc 4 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1 crt 0
3 mode RUN
5 source OFF
